1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,260
I can't believe we've never done this. It's so good!
我們居然沒試過 真舒服

3
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:09,960
It's so good for Monica.
摩妮卡好舒服

4
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:14,640
Time's up! My turn.
時間到，該我了

5
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:19,210
-That was half an hour? -It's your timer.
已經半小時了？ 計時器是你的

6
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:27,110
I don't like to brag about it, but I give the best massages.
我不想自誇，但我最會按摩了

7
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:30,190
All right,then massage me up right nice!
那就給我按下去吧

8
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,830
It's so good,isn't it?
很舒服吧？

9
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:39,300
I don't know what I did to deserve it.
舒服到我覺得我無福消受

10
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,060
Now stop trying to add more time to your massage.
別想把時間延長

11
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,500
Say goodbye to sore muscles!
跟酸痛肌肉說再見吧 

12
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:50,710
Goodbye,muscles!
肌肉，再見

13
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:54,380
The One with Joey's Bag
本集播出：「父女相認」

00:00:56,150 --> 00:00:57,380
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

14
00:01:39,660 --> 00:01:42,150
She gives the worst massages ever!
她的按摩技術爛到不行

15
00:01:43,430 --> 00:01:46,660
It was like she was torturing me for information.
感覺就像她在拷問我

16
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:50,540
I wanted to give it up. I just didn't know what it was!
我很想招，又不知道要招什麼

17
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:54,340
If it hurts that bad, you should tell her.
要是真的很痛，你應該告訴她

18
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:57,340
For the first time, I'm in a real relationship.
我這輩子第一次這麼認真 

19
00:01:57,610 --> 00:02:00,780
I won't screw that up by telling the truth.
我才不要因為說實話而搞砸

20
00:02:02,950 --> 00:02:04,380
Dude,look out!
小心

21
00:02:04,650 --> 00:02:06,280
You almost crushed my hat.
你差點踩扁我的帽子 

22
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:08,150
Sorry.
對不起

23
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:11,050
And the bunny got away.
兔子跑走了

24
00:02:19,270 --> 00:02:22,630
This would be the place where you explain the hat.
你該解釋這頂帽子的事了

25
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:30,140
This is called a top hat.
這個叫禮帽

26
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:36,970
And why are you wearing this? Is it "top hat"?
你為何要戴這頂…禮帽是吧？

27
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:41,210
There's this play...
現在有一出舞台劇

28
00:02:41,490 --> 00:02:45,390
...and I'm up for the part of this cool, suave, international guy.
我要去應徵一個很有品位的角色

29
00:02:45,660 --> 00:02:47,490
A clotheshorse. So I figure...
他很會穿衣服 我估計...

30
00:02:47,730 --> 00:02:52,260
...everyone at the audition will wear ultra-hip,high-fashion stuff.
...去試鏡的人 一定都會穿得很時尚有品位

31
00:02:52,530 --> 00:02:54,260
And you'll make them disappear?
你要把他們都變不見？

32
00:02:55,540 --> 00:02:58,730
Like you could find something this sophisticated.
有什麼比這頂帽子更有品？

33
00:03:00,410 --> 00:03:01,600
Done!
搞定

34
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:07,110
If you want to look good, come to the store. I'll help you.
喬伊，你可以來找我選衣服

35
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:08,780
-Thanks! -Sure.
太好了，謝謝

36
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,570
Please, take those off!
不客氣…拜託快拿掉

37
00:03:14,020 --> 00:03:16,050
Hey,Phoebe. How's it going?
菲比，今天好嗎？

38
00:03:16,690 --> 00:03:20,090
Only okay because I just got back from the hospital.
還好而已，因為我剛去過醫院

39
00:03:20,700 --> 00:03:22,130
Are you all right?
什麼？ 你還好嗎？

40
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:25,360
I'm fine, but my grandma sort of died.
不，我很好，但是我外婆死了

41
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:27,890
Phoebe,sorry.
真遺憾

42
00:03:28,070 --> 00:03:29,060
It's okay.
沒關係

43
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:31,270
She had a really incredible life.
她這一生過得很精彩

44
00:03:31,540 --> 00:03:34,530
It's not like I won't see her again. She'll visit.
我也不是永遠見不到她 她會來找我

45
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:39,770
Maybe she's with us right now.
也許她現在就在這裡？

46
00:03:40,050 --> 00:03:44,920
Right. She's on a new spiritual plain and she'll come to the coffeehouse.
是啊，第一天進入新世界 結果跑來咖啡館

47
00:03:45,150 --> 00:03:48,610
I just saw two people having sex in a car right outside!
喂！外面車上有兩個人在嘿咻

48
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:54,050
Phoebe' grandmother just died.
菲比的外婆剛過世

49
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:57,560
Oh,my God! I'm so sorry.
天哪，對不起

50
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:01,090
Actually, it's kind of cool. Because it's like...
沒關係，其實這樣還蠻酷的 

51
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:04,170
...you know,one life ends and another begins.
一個生命結束 另一個生命誕生

52
00:04:05,910 --> 00:04:08,170
Not the way they're doing it.
他們的做法很難

53
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:12,740
What happened? How did she die?
怎麼回事？她是怎麼過世的？

54
00:04:12,980 --> 00:04:14,110
We were in the market...
我們在超市...

55
00:04:14,350 --> 00:04:18,980
...and she bent down to get some yogurt and never came back up again.
她彎腰去拿優格 就再也沒起來過

57
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:21,590
I'm so sorry.
真令人遺憾

58
00:04:21,790 --> 00:04:23,690
The last thing she said was:
她最後說的話倒很窩心

59
00:04:23,930 --> 00:04:28,860
"You get the eggs, I'll get the yogurt, and we'll meet at the checkout counter."
「你去拿蛋，我拿優格」 「我們在出口見」

60
00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:30,520
You know what?
你們知道嗎？ 

61
00:04:30,970 --> 00:04:33,370
We will meet at the checkout counter.
我們絕對會在人生的出口見

62
00:04:39,078 --> 00:04:40,670
（布魯明戴爾百貨公司）

63
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:43,980
Since you're returning all this stuff...
衣服得歸還

64
00:04:44,210 --> 00:04:46,310
...you'll have to wear underwear.
所以你得穿內褲

65
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:50,280
All right. You'd better show me that too.
好，那你還得拿內褲給我

66
00:04:51,890 --> 00:04:54,050
It's missing something.
還少了點什麼…

68
00:05:01,730 --> 00:05:03,460
Really? A purse?
我知道了 皮包喔？

69
00:05:03,670 --> 00:05:06,530
It's not a purse. It's a shoulder bag.
這不是皮包，是背包

70
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,230
It looks like a woman's purse.
很像女人的皮包

71
00:05:09,970 --> 00:05:14,030
Trust me, all the men are carrying them in the spring catalog.
不，相信我 春季型錄上的男模都在背

72
00:05:14,310 --> 00:05:16,970
See,look. Men carrying the bag.
你看，男人，背包包

73
00:05:17,850 --> 00:05:20,510
See,look. Women carrying the bag.
你看，女人，背包包

74
00:05:27,890 --> 00:05:33,020
But it is odd how a woman's purse looks so good on me, a man.
我一個男人背女用皮包 居然很帥

75
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:36,520
Exactly. Unisex!
沒錯，男女通用 （音同「你需要性愛」）

76
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:39,890
Maybe you need sex. I had sex a couple days ago.
你或許需要，我2天前剛做過

77
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:45,030
No,Joey. U-N-I sex.
不，我是說男女通用 （音同「你和我做愛」）

78
00:05:46,710 --> 00:05:49,070
I ain't gonna say no to that!
我絕對不會拒絕

79
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,350
-Who is it? -It's Phoebe.
哪一位？ 菲比

80
00:05:59,620 --> 00:06:01,020
Oh,great!
太好了

81
00:06:01,890 --> 00:06:03,690
Oh,you.
原來是你…

82
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:05,690
What's up?
有什麼事？

83
00:06:07,700 --> 00:06:11,260
Well,I sort of have some bad news. Can I come in?
有個壞消息，我可以進去嗎？

84
00:06:12,730 --> 00:06:13,760
No,thanks.
還是不要好了

85
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:21,200
Grandma died today.
外婆今天死了

86
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:24,800
Didn't she die like five years ago?
她不是5年前就死了？

87
00:06:25,110 --> 00:06:27,480
No,she just died today.
不是，她今天剛死

88
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:31,150
We're having a memorial service tomorrow.
明天要舉行告別式

89
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:34,120
Okay,I know I went to that already.
我參加過她的告別式了

90
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:35,820
No,you didn't!
你才沒有

91
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,610
Then who's been dead?
那是誰死了5年？ 

92
00:06:37,890 --> 00:06:39,050
Lots of people!
很多人

93
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:43,650
-Look,are you coming or not? -No.
你到底要不要來？ 不要

94
00:06:47,570 --> 00:06:50,730
I thought she was dead, so I've made my peace.
我以為她已經死了 我已經接受這件事了

95
00:06:52,410 --> 00:06:54,170
Plus I'm going to a concert.
而且我明天要聽演唱會

96
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:57,930
I'd invite you, but I only have two tickets left.
我也想找你，但我只剩兩張票

97
00:06:59,580 --> 00:07:03,950
-Fine. Okay,enjoy your concert. -Thanks. Enjoy your funeral!
好，你慢慢聽 謝了，你慢慢告別

98
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:18,600
You look just like your son, Mrs. Tribbiani.
崔比亞尼太太 你長得真像你兒子

99
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,830
What? Are you referring to my man's bag?
什麼？你在說我的男用包包？

100
00:07:24,470 --> 00:07:27,770
I thought it just looked good, but it's practical too.
我原以為它只中看 結果它也很中用，你們看

101
00:07:28,210 --> 00:07:32,170
It's got compartments for your wallet,keys,address book....
各種夾層都有 放皮夾的 放鑰匙的 放電話簿的 

102
00:07:32,350 --> 00:07:33,340
Your makeup.
放化妝品的

103
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:38,210
What are you doing? The audition's tomorrow.
喬伊，你怎麼背著包包？ 你明天才試鏡

104
00:07:38,490 --> 00:07:41,010
Yeah,but sandwich time is right now.
但現在是三明治時間

105
00:07:41,690 --> 00:07:44,450
You get mustard on that bag, you can't return it.
要是沾到芥末就不能還了

106
00:07:44,690 --> 00:07:47,490
Why would I return this? I love this bag!
幹嘛要還？我愛這個包包

107
00:07:47,730 --> 00:07:51,030
-All right,then you owe me $350. -Fine.
好，那你欠我350  好

108
00:07:51,530 --> 00:07:54,520
Do you take Vasa or Mooster Card?
你收VASA或萬事達嗎

109
00:07:56,840 --> 00:08:01,970
Relax,I'll pay you with the money from the job I'll get. Thanks to you.
別緊張啦 你幫我拿到這個角色 到時領了錢就給你

111
00:08:02,210 --> 00:08:04,870
What's the part? Auntie Mame?
什麼角色，反男人？

112
00:08:05,350 --> 00:08:07,710
Don't listen to them. I think it's sexy.
別理他們，我覺得很性感

113
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:10,250
You-and-I sexy?
你和我，性感？

114
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:20,380
Hello,Mrs. Pinilla. Thank you for coming.
潘奈拉太太，謝謝你來

115
00:08:20,660 --> 00:08:22,650
Here's your 3-D glasses.
這是你的3D眼鏡

116
00:08:25,370 --> 00:08:27,990
Reverend Pong will say when to put them on.
要戴時彭牧師會說

117
00:08:31,710 --> 00:08:33,000
Hi,sweetie.
嗨，親愛的

118
00:08:33,210 --> 00:08:35,200
-How are you holding up? -Fine.
你還好嗎？ 還好

119
00:08:35,580 --> 00:08:38,010
Hey,Phoebe. I'm so sorry.
節哀順變

120
00:08:39,850 --> 00:08:43,250
You know what? My grandma had the exact same bag!
我外婆有個一模一樣的包包

121
00:08:44,190 --> 00:08:45,380
I brought you flowers.
我帶了花來 

122
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:47,110
Oh,thanks!
謝謝

123
00:08:47,390 --> 00:08:50,290
Pulling flowers out makes the bag look masculine.
這樣感覺有男人味多了

124
00:08:53,390 --> 00:08:55,620
Excuse me,is this the memorial?
請問告別式是在這裡嗎？

125
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:57,390
Yeah.Welcome. Hello.
對，歡迎 你好

126
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:59,270
Here's your 3-D glasses.
這是你的3D眼鏡 

127
00:08:59,570 --> 00:09:01,200
Thanks. All right.
謝謝，好

128
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:05,200
So how did you know Frances?
你是怎麼認識法蘭西絲的？

129
00:09:05,410 --> 00:09:07,970
Actually,I hadn't seen her for years.
我們多年不見

130
00:09:08,310 --> 00:09:12,970
But I was pretty tight with her and her daughter.
我以前跟她和她的女兒很親

131
00:09:13,250 --> 00:09:14,410
What's your name?
是嗎？尊姓大名？ 

132
00:09:14,650 --> 00:09:16,310
Frank Buffay.
法蘭克布非

133
00:09:19,090 --> 00:09:22,720
You know what? Strike that. My name,actually,is Joe.
更正，其實我叫…喬

134
00:09:24,130 --> 00:09:25,620
Joe Hill.
喬希爾 

135
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:26,780
You're Frank Buf
你是法蘭克布非？

136
00:09:27,090 --> 00:09:29,390
No! Joe Hill.
不是，喬希爾

137
00:09:30,730 --> 00:09:31,720
You just said
你剛才說… 

138
00:09:31,970 --> 00:09:34,760
I got to go. Thank you so much for coming.
我該走了，謝謝你來

139
00:09:36,642 --> 00:09:37,904
But...
但是…

140
00:09:38,810 --> 00:09:40,100
Oh,my God!
我的天哪

141
00:09:40,340 --> 00:09:41,470
What happened?
什麼？ 怎麼了？

142
00:09:41,910 --> 00:09:43,070
That was my dad.
那是我爸 天哪

143
00:09:44,780 --> 00:09:45,910
Check it out!
你們看

144
00:09:46,910 --> 00:09:48,910
It's like it's coming right at me.
我的手好像正朝著我來

145
00:09:58,330 --> 00:10:00,590
-Did you catch him? -What did he say?
追到他了嗎？ 他怎麼說？

146
00:10:00,830 --> 00:10:04,030
He said, "Nice to meet you,Glenda."
他說：很高興認識你，葛蘭達

148
00:10:05,300 --> 00:10:07,430
I couldn't give him my real name.
我當然不能說出真名 

149
00:10:07,670 --> 00:10:08,760
Why not?
為什麼？

150
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,470
You saw the way he ran.
你們也看到他走得像飛了

151
00:10:10,670 --> 00:10:13,470
You think he'd talk to the daughter he abandoned?
難不成他會留下來 跟他拋棄的女兒聊天？

152
00:10:13,710 --> 00:10:15,440
What did you say to him?
那你怎麼說？

153
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:19,870
I said I was the executor of the will and I needed to talk to him.
我自稱法蘭西絲的遺囑執行人 有事找他談

154
00:10:20,150 --> 00:10:22,980
I'm going to meet him at the coffeehouse.
我們待會約在咖啡館

155
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:24,880
Could everyone take their seats?
請各位就座

156
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:27,810
I just can't think about that now.
我現在沒辦法想這個

157
00:10:28,190 --> 00:10:30,490
I want to say goodbye to my grandma.
我只想跟我外婆道別 好

158
00:10:31,290 --> 00:10:32,550
Let's go say goodbye.
走吧

159
00:10:45,810 --> 00:10:48,240
I'm off to my audition. How do I look?
我要去面試了，怎麼樣？

160
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:52,200
Great! That bag will get you that part.
帥呆了，那個包包會讓你包中

161
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,070
And a date with a man.
還能釣到男人

162
00:10:56,050 --> 00:11:00,150
You know what? Make fun all you want. This is a great bag.
隨你怎麼取笑我 這個包包很棒

163
00:11:00,390 --> 00:11:03,050
And it's as handy as it is becoming.
而且是好看又好用

164
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:07,420
Just because you don't understand something, doesn't make it wrong.
你們不懂不代表是錯的

165
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:10,830
You guys have to get used to the fact that Joey...
以後你們都得習慣有喬伊…

166
00:11:11,570 --> 00:11:13,330
...comes with a bag!
就有包包

167
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:17,190
I've got to meet my dad.
我也該走了，我得去見我爸

168
00:11:17,540 --> 00:11:19,200
Will you tell him who you are?
你會表明你的身份嗎？

169
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:22,030
Not at first. I don't want to freak him out.
先不會，我不想嚇跑他

170
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:24,180
But aren't you pissed at him?
但是你不氣他嗎？ 

171
00:11:24,410 --> 00:11:26,380
This guy abandoned you.
這傢伙遺棄了你

172
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:30,880
If it were me, this guy would be in some serious physical danger.
如果是我，他就等著挨揍吧

173
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:35,850
I'd walk in there, I'd be like, "Yo,Dad!
我會走進去說 「喂，老爸」

174
00:11:36,090 --> 00:11:39,290
You and me,outside. Right now!"
「我們現在就出去解決」

175
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:42,090
I kind of scared myself.
我都嚇到自己了

176
00:11:43,260 --> 00:11:45,360
Well,at least you scared someone.
那起碼有嚇到人

177
00:11:47,270 --> 00:11:49,200
You'd think I'd be angry.
說也奇怪，我應該很生氣

178
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:53,530
You'd think I'd want to rip his tiny, little head off!
我應該很想扭斷他那顆頭

179
00:11:54,310 --> 00:11:56,640
Fortunately, I'm past it.
幸好我已經釋懷了

180
00:11:57,110 --> 00:12:00,810
You do seem a little tense. Here,let me help you.
你看起來的確有點緊繃 我幫你捏一捏 好

182
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:02,140
Get off!
放開我！

183
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:06,310
Stop it! Why are you doing that to me?
住手！你為什麼這樣苦毒我？

184
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,320
What are you talking about?
你在說什麼？

185
00:12:08,590 --> 00:12:11,390
As a masseuse and a human...
身為一個按摩師和一個人類

186
00:12:11,730 --> 00:12:15,060
...I'm begging you, never do that to anyone!
我懇求你永遠別幫別人按摩

187
00:12:16,100 --> 00:12:17,720
I give good massages.
我很會按摩啊

188
00:12:20,470 --> 00:12:23,100
I gave them to Rachel before she got allergic.
我以前都幫瑞秋按摩 是她後來會過敏

189
00:12:25,810 --> 00:12:28,500
And Chandler, he loves them! Watch.
錢德也很喜歡，你看

190
00:12:30,310 --> 00:12:32,640
He does not like it. He's in pain!
他才不喜歡，他痛得快要死了

191
00:12:32,910 --> 00:12:35,610
-No,he's not. -Yes,he is!
他才沒有 他有

192
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:39,580
-What? -I'm sorry,but
什麼？ 對不起，但是…

193
00:12:44,130 --> 00:12:45,420
You've been lying to me?
你一直在騙我？

194
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:47,350
I can't believe that.
我真不敢相信

195
00:12:47,630 --> 00:12:49,620
Maybe he didn't want to hurt you.
也許他只是不希望你難過

196
00:12:49,860 --> 00:12:53,130
But the minute we start to lie to each other....
但我們一旦開始欺騙對方…

197
00:12:56,500 --> 00:12:57,490
And by "we"...
我說的「我們」...

198
00:12:58,170 --> 00:12:59,870
...I mean society.
...指的是社會

199
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:05,010
Anytime you're ready.
你好了就開始

200
00:13:05,710 --> 00:13:07,770
Well,you must be new here.
你一定是新來的

201
00:13:08,020 --> 00:13:10,310
Maybe we get a table, I buy you a drink.
我們找張桌子，我請你喝一杯

202
00:13:10,620 --> 00:13:12,810
Could you try it without the purse?
抱歉，你能不能不要背皮包？

203
00:13:14,890 --> 00:13:16,520
Yeah,sure.
當然可以

204
00:13:20,330 --> 00:13:24,130
Well,you must be new here. Maybe we sit
你一定是新來的 我們找張…

205
00:13:24,630 --> 00:13:26,160
Can I ask you something?
抱歉，我可以問一件事嗎？

206
00:13:26,370 --> 00:13:27,360
Sure. What?
可以，什麼事？

207
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:30,160
Well,first, it's not a purse.
第一，這不是皮包

208
00:13:32,210 --> 00:13:33,230
Anytime.
好，再來

209
00:13:33,510 --> 00:13:35,910
If you think it's a woman's bag,it's not.
別以為這是女用皮包 

210
00:13:36,180 --> 00:13:38,080
It's a man's bag.
這是男用提包

211
00:13:38,980 --> 00:13:41,540
Okay. And go!
好的，繼續吧

212
00:13:42,680 --> 00:13:45,240
Let me show you the catalog.
我拿型錄給你看

213
00:13:45,890 --> 00:13:47,010
Look. See?
你看

214
00:13:48,590 --> 00:13:50,020
It's the latest thing.
這是最新流行 

215
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:53,090
Everyone's got one. Men,women,children.
男人、女人、小孩都在背

216
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:54,690
Do you sell these?
你在推銷這些包包嗎？

217
00:13:57,360 --> 00:14:00,060
No,these babies sell themselves.
不是，這些包包擺著就能賣

218
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,000
Thank you. That was great.
好，謝謝，你表現得很好

219
00:14:03,500 --> 00:14:05,030
But I didn't read anything.
我什麼都還沒念 

220
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:07,400
I think we've seen enough.
我想這樣就夠了

221
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:10,730
All right,I'll see you.
那好，再見

222
00:14:11,010 --> 00:14:12,770
We got it. We got it.
搞定了，搞定了

223
00:14:15,380 --> 00:14:16,410
-Is Rachel here? -No.
瑞秋在嗎？ 不在

224
00:14:17,950 --> 00:14:22,720
Listen, I just wanted to apologize about the whole massage thing.
聽我說 我想為下午和按摩的事道歉

225
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:25,450
I really like them.
我很喜歡你的按摩 

226
00:14:26,230 --> 00:14:28,220
Please,stop!
別再硬撐了

227
00:14:29,560 --> 00:14:31,460
We're supposed to be honest.
我們應該坦誠相對

228
00:14:31,870 --> 00:14:35,390
I wish you could tell me, "l don't like your massages."
我只希望你能明白告訴我 「我不喜歡你的按摩」

229
00:14:40,110 --> 00:14:42,600
I don't like your massages.
我不喜歡你的按摩

230
00:14:44,710 --> 00:14:47,150
See? It's no big deal.
看吧，又沒什麼

231
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:50,150
But now you're crying!
但是你哭了

232
00:14:50,380 --> 00:14:54,550
I'm not crying about that. I'm crying about something at work.
我不是在哭這個 我是在哭公司的事

233
00:14:55,760 --> 00:14:58,880
-What? -My boyfriend said he didn't like my massages.
什麼事？ 我男朋友說他不喜歡我的按摩

235
00:14:59,660 --> 00:15:02,130
You don't have to be best at everything.
你又不必事事都搶第一

236
00:15:02,330 --> 00:15:05,990
Oh,my God! You don't know me at all!
天哪，你一點也不暸解我

237
00:15:09,300 --> 00:15:11,770
You give the worst massages in the world.
好，你的按摩技術天下第一爛

238
00:15:12,070 --> 00:15:14,060
I'm crying here!
我在哭耶

239
00:15:14,780 --> 00:15:15,970
Look,hear me out.
聽我說完 

240
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:19,510
You give the best bad-massages.
比爛的話你天下第一

241
00:15:20,450 --> 00:15:23,470
If anybody was looking for the best bad-massage...
如果有人在找最棒的爛按摩

242
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:26,020
...and they thought, "Who's the best?"
他們自問：誰的爛技術最棒？ 

243
00:15:26,250 --> 00:15:27,690
They'd have to go to you.
那絕對非你莫屬

244
00:15:33,860 --> 00:15:37,090
So you're saying that if there was an award...
你的意思是 如果有...

245
00:15:37,330 --> 00:15:41,860
...for the best bad-massage.... Who would get that?
...最佳爛按摩技術獎 那誰會得獎？ 
 
247
00:15:42,140 --> 00:15:43,760
It would be you!
一定是你

248
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:47,130
You,Monica! And you'd get all the votes.
你，摩妮卡 你會大獲全勝

249
00:15:48,310 --> 00:15:50,710
So they could call the award, "The Monica"?
或許這個獎可以叫摩妮卡獎？

250
00:15:52,950 --> 00:15:54,140
Absolutely.
一定會的

251
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:58,950
-I suck! -Yeah.
我爛透了 沒錯

252
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:07,490
Thank you for meeting me.
謝謝你來見我 

253
00:16:07,730 --> 00:16:09,130
Thank you.
謝謝

254
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,230
Come sit.
這邊坐

255
00:16:13,500 --> 00:16:14,800
Sit.
坐啊

256
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,670
Sit!
坐

257
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:21,540
Alrighty. Before we get started,I need you...
好的，在開始之前  

258
00:16:21,740 --> 00:16:25,910
...to state for the record that you are,in fact,Frank Buffay.
你必須鄭重聲明 你其實是法蘭克布非

260
00:16:26,180 --> 00:16:28,150
Yes,I am.
是的，我是

262
00:16:31,250 --> 00:16:32,840
What did Frances leave me?
法蘭西絲留給我什麼？

263
00:16:34,050 --> 00:16:35,850
That's why you wanted me to come.
這是你找我來的原因吧？ 

264
00:16:37,590 --> 00:16:40,420
Yes,she did. She left you...
是的 的確有，她留給你…

265
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,830
...this lipstick.
這支口紅

266
00:16:46,705 --> 00:16:48,673
這真是…

267
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,870
It's used.
這是用過的

268
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,610
Cool!
酷

269
00:16:57,380 --> 00:17:02,440
I have just a few questions to ask, so I'll get out my official forms.
我要請教幾個問題 我把相關表格拿出來

270
00:17:05,950 --> 00:17:07,890
Okay. So question one:
好，第一個問題

271
00:17:08,590 --> 00:17:12,420
You were married to Frances' daughter,Lilly. Correct?
你娶了法蘭西絲的女兒莉莉 正不正確？

272
00:17:12,630 --> 00:17:14,620
Yes,I was.
對，沒錯 

273
00:17:15,600 --> 00:17:18,220
Question two. Did that marriage end:
好，第二個問題 這段婚姻

274
00:17:18,470 --> 00:17:20,060
A: Happily?
一：很美滿 

275
00:17:20,370 --> 00:17:22,600
B: Medium?
二：普通

276
00:17:22,900 --> 00:17:26,030
Or C: In the total abandonment...
三：你最後...

277
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:28,300
...of her and her two children?
...拋妻棄子

278
00:17:29,210 --> 00:17:30,400
It really says that?
表上真的這麼寫？ 

279
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,740
Yeah,see?
對，你看

280
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:36,150
I guess then I would have to say C.
那我就得選三了 

281
00:17:37,790 --> 00:17:39,450
Total abandonment.
好，拋妻棄子

282
00:17:40,950 --> 00:17:42,650
Reasons for abandonment:
拋棄的原因

283
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:46,290
A: Top-secret government work.
一：極機密政府工作 

284
00:17:46,890 --> 00:17:47,990
B: Amnesia.
二：失意症

285
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:51,560
Or C: You're just a selfish, irresponsible...
或是三 你就是個自私不負責的...

286
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:54,230
...bad,bad man.
大壞蛋

287
00:17:54,770 --> 00:17:57,170
I don't want the lipstick that much.
其實我沒那麼想要這支口紅

288
00:17:58,940 --> 00:18:02,240
Would you do me a favor?
請你幫個忙

289
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:04,170
Would you give Lilly...
把這個交給莉莉

290
00:18:05,150 --> 00:18:06,310
...that,please? -What?
拜託. 什麼？

291
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:09,510
When you see Lilly, give her that note.
請把那張紙條交給她

292
00:18:09,750 --> 00:18:12,150
I wanted to talk to her at the memorial...
我本來想在告別式上找她談 

293
00:18:12,650 --> 00:18:17,420
...but I pictured her getting mad the way you did,and I chickened out.
但我覺得她也會像你這樣發飆 就臨陣退縮了

295
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:20,630
I wrote her a note. Give it to her,please?
我寫了那張紙條，請幫我轉交

296
00:18:20,860 --> 00:18:23,490
But you came to see Lilly?
你想來找莉莉？ 

297
00:18:24,530 --> 00:18:25,590
Yeah. Why?
對，怎麼了？

298
00:18:26,670 --> 00:18:28,460
Lilly's dead.
莉莉死了

299
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,130
She what?
什麼？ 

300
00:18:31,540 --> 00:18:32,530
She's dead.
她死了

301
00:18:33,170 --> 00:18:34,160
Are you sure?
你確定？ 

302
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:37,540
If she isn't,cremating her was a big mistake.
沒死就被火化就嚴重了

303
00:18:39,010 --> 00:18:41,810
I can't believe this. I just can't believe
我真不敢相信，怎麼會…

304
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:44,810
How? Oh,my God.
天哪， 怎麼會？

305
00:18:45,650 --> 00:18:46,640
How long ago?
多久的事？

306
00:18:46,990 --> 00:18:48,450
17 years ago.
17年前

307
00:18:51,290 --> 00:18:53,230
What about the girls?
那女孩們呢？

308
00:18:56,160 --> 00:19:00,030
Well,Ursula is a waitress and she lives in Soho.
烏蘇拉在當服務生，住在蘇活

309
00:19:01,900 --> 00:19:03,700
And Phoebe...
菲比…

310
00:19:05,470 --> 00:19:07,300
...is on this couch.
就坐在這張沙發上

311
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:18,680
Yep, lipstick and a daughter. Big day for you!
沒錯，口紅和女兒 真是黃道吉日

312
00:19:19,990 --> 00:19:22,920
Phoebe,l....
菲比，我…

313
00:19:25,390 --> 00:19:28,560
It's just,I don't know what to say.
我不知道該說什麼

314
00:19:29,930 --> 00:19:34,700
I just can't believe that you're my daughter. You're so pretty.
你居然是我的女兒 你長得這麼漂亮

315
00:19:36,100 --> 00:19:38,730
Yes, well, that's neither here nor there.
那個跟這個無關

316
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:43,840
Would it make you feel better if I said...
你會不會好過一點

317
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:47,710
...that I was very,very sorry I left?
如果我說我非常非常抱歉 

318
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:53,250
It doesn't matter what you say. It won't make a difference.
你說什麼都沒區別了 

319
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:55,010
So you can just go.
所以你可以走了

320
00:19:56,790 --> 00:20:01,750
Well,you know,in my defense, I was a lousy father.
好…我要辯解一下 我很不會當爸爸

321
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:04,720
-That's your defense? -Yes,it is.
這叫辯解？ 沒錯

322
00:20:04,970 --> 00:20:08,960
I burned the formula, and I put your diapers on backwards.
我把牛奶燒焦，把尿布包反

323
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:13,800
I made up a song to sing to you, but that made you cry even more.
我做了一首歌哄你睡覺 結果你哭得更厲害

324
00:20:14,710 --> 00:20:15,870
You make up songs?
你會寫歌？ 

325
00:20:16,110 --> 00:20:19,240
Well,no,just that one. But it was stupid.
只有那一首 不過很白癡

326
00:20:19,450 --> 00:20:22,280
Let's see,how did it go?
我想想怎麼唱…

327
00:20:23,650 --> 00:20:26,640
Sleepy girl,sleepy girl
愛困妹，愛困妹 

329
00:20:27,290 --> 00:20:30,090
Why won't you go to sleep?
你為什麼不睡覺？

330
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:33,390
Sleepy girl,sleepy girl
愛困妹，愛困妹 

331
00:20:33,660 --> 00:20:35,790
You're keeping me up
你害我不能睡覺

332
00:20:54,820 --> 00:20:56,780
I'm not very good at this.
我實在…這種事我不太行

333
00:20:59,950 --> 00:21:01,320
Well,I am.
我很行

334
00:21:06,990 --> 00:21:07,980
Not yet. No.
現在還不行

335
00:21:14,030 --> 00:21:15,160
How'd the audition go?
結果如何？ 

336
00:21:15,540 --> 00:21:16,970
Estelle said I didn't get it.
經紀人說沒中

337
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:20,470
What? Why? Joey, you were so ready for it.
什麼？你準備得那麼充分

338
00:21:20,710 --> 00:21:22,040
I thought so too...
我也這麼想 

339
00:21:22,310 --> 00:21:24,900
...but the casting people had problems with me.
但她說選角的人對我有意見

340
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:26,370
What kind of problem?
什麼意見？

341
00:21:26,710 --> 00:21:29,240
To tell you the truth...
老實說

342
00:21:29,520 --> 00:21:31,750
...they had a problem with the bag!
他們不喜歡這個包包 

343
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:35,850
You know what? It was a stupid play anyway.
反正也是出爛戲

344
00:21:36,760 --> 00:21:38,520
It's time to give up the bag.
喬伊，你該放棄這個包包了

345
00:21:38,990 --> 00:21:41,360
I don't want to give up the bag.
我不想放棄它

346
00:21:41,830 --> 00:21:44,320
I don't have to give it up. Do l,Rach?
我不必放棄它，對吧 瑞秋？

347
00:21:47,730 --> 00:21:50,170
You think I should give up the bag!
你覺得我應該放棄 

348
00:21:50,500 --> 00:21:54,870
Joey, I'm sorry. As terrific as I think you are with it...
喬伊，對不起 我覺得你背起來很帥

349
00:21:57,010 --> 00:22:01,780
...I just don't know if the world is ready for you and your bag.
但世人或許還沒辦法接受你和你的包包

350
00:22:04,250 --> 00:22:05,840
I can't believe this!
你居然這麼說 

351
00:22:06,090 --> 00:22:09,280
Wait,I'm not saying you shouldn't have a bag.
等等，我不是說你不該帶包包

352
00:22:10,560 --> 00:22:14,720
There are other bags that are maybe a little less...
但有其他爭議性比較小的...

353
00:22:15,460 --> 00:22:16,950
...controversial.
...包包

354
00:22:18,030 --> 00:22:20,690
Yeah,they're called wallets.
對，叫做皮夾

355
00:22:23,500 --> 00:22:25,230
You're right. You're right.
你們說得對

356
00:22:25,410 --> 00:22:27,810
This bag has become like a part of me.
只是它已經成為我的一部分 

357
00:22:27,970 --> 00:22:31,030
It's like...my bag.
它就像是…我的包包

358
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:34,480
It had a place for everything.
什麼東西都有地方擺

359
00:22:35,550 --> 00:22:37,410
-Oh,man. -What?
討厭 怎麼了？

360
00:22:37,580 --> 00:22:42,720
There's a whole series of pockets here I didn't even know about, Rach. Look.
有一組暗袋我沒發現啦，瑞秋

361
00:22:46,860 --> 00:22:49,450
Ursula,I have the most amazing news.
烏蘇拉，我有個天大的消息 

362
00:22:49,630 --> 00:22:51,790
I found our dad.
我找到爸了

363
00:22:51,970 --> 00:22:53,460
Phoebe.
菲比啊

364
00:22:56,440 --> 00:23:00,670
Your sister. And I found our dad.
你妹妹，我找到爸了

365
